id="e42a162d-e3ea-4a77-be02-2f0f42ae79dc" tabindex="0" role="link" class="vy-r-1cwdm8e" style="cursor: pointer;"><div data-rid="240619d4-5de8-4fff-b760-8c8de0d9bbf8" class="vy-r-1eue141 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Top 5</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d0aeaf53-7642-43a8-acec-fb102c08eebd" class="vy-r-1ojtsry"><div data-rid="8cbd47fa-8038-421c-87fa-d2d7b38fb722" class="vy-r-zu4xv1"><picture data-rid="4302e592-f3f3-45b3-8f4c-7b85830c9ecd" class="vy-r-auo9tv"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-4.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-4.jpg" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-35.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-4.jpg" class="vy-r-cf2dcp" loading="eager"></picture><div data-rid="7b3476bf-e901-4521-82bc-3eab0d09ff2c" class="vy-r-15fm40q vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Why Most Mullein Labels Leave You Guessing</h3></span></div><div data-rid="1f4e2fe3-7eb8-4b56-8cbe-f7ecb558dfaa" class="vy-r-bxo29m vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You have probably heard about mullein by now. It is an old one, used for lung support back to Greek and Roman physicians, and plenty of people take it as part of a daily routine. The awkward part is the bottle, because most of them tell you almost nothing.<br><br></p><p>So you order one. The dropper tastes like a hedge, you take it every morning for a few weeks, and you still could not tell anyone how much mullein you are getting.<br><br></p><p>Here's what I figured out: <strong>mullein is not the problem here. The problem is what these bottles print and what they leave off. Some never publish an extract ratio at all, and one advertises ingredients that appear nowhere on its own label.</strong><br><br></p><p>Once I stopped reading the front of the box, three things decided which of these I would buy again and which one I would send back.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="4ad91fee-94ae-4637-8acc-87f108c46ca0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="What to Look For" tabindex="-1" id="What to Look For" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="vy-r-225r8t"><div data-rid="b7b5dc5c-a90c-4caa-a17f-d165fbb02cbc" class="vy-r-10dv42l vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>The 3 Things Every Honest Mullein Label Must Show</h2></span></div><div data-rid="3a802f68-34f3-4149-8f73-faeb7ad19099" class="vy-r-1r4bvor" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b7808ccd-8255-495c-8cb2-f59804f5d14c" class="vy-r-basedn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9605c98a-2654-46de-ba4d-6c86196df4a2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1j8n32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="vy-r-1vttmrb" style="cursor: pointer;"><div data-rid="5517445c-cb4f-4907-9078-8b10cf312825" class="vy-r-1enlhbf"><div data-rid="ec0fd7a1-7984-4c5e-9cf0-e3ba59f2f49b" class="vy-r-1dqrb7g vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>1.</h3></span></div><div data-rid="8b9e4739-ba56-4b25-99f9-5521385422d4" class="vy-r-1ha2c45 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h4>A Printed Dose and Extract Ratio</h4></span></div></div><div data-rid="396313e0-d7c9-4b5b-a4f2-614aa4bdf398" class="vy-r-1w4lk9o" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-1cus9wk" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="vy-replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1j8n32:" style=""><div style="padding:4px 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151"><p>Every bottle here says mullein on the front. That tells you nothing. What matters is how many milligrams are in a serving and how concentrated the extract is, because 280 mg of a 10:1 extract is not the same thing as 700 mg of plain leaf. Most of these print both numbers. One skips the ratio entirely, so there is no honest way to compare it with the rest.</p></div></div></div><div data-rid="2f2737da-d7d6-4ef4-b62c-9f9321d17302" class="vy-r-1uuvst0" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b1e8c609-e8c6-45b4-880b-29857a9c852b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2j8n32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="vy-r-1nu0wif" style="cursor: pointer;"><div data-rid="096c5b63-0f29-440a-ade1-ac04e04b72b6" class="vy-r-l6m3tx"><div data-rid="c6e0c339-4659-43c5-b94c-e55cbb8db37f" class="vy-r-10n43jr vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>2.</h3></span></div><div data-rid="106b04f1-77b8-4cae-8e57-2dcf4d277a08" class="vy-r-1rog5n1 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p> A Short Ingredient List, Lab Tested</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="5bb81571-8489-4f47-9b91-5042d181bd30" class="vy-r-1rdb707" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-159yh49" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="vy-replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2j8n32:" style=""><div style="padding:4px 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151"><p>Turn the bottle around and read the small print. You are looking for what rides along with the mullein: alcohol, added sugar, glycerin, flavorings, a licorice root nobody warned you about. One of the five is a gummy carrying two grams of added sugar per serving. Then check whether an outside lab has tested the batch, because a seal is cheap to print and a lab report is not.</p></div></div></div><div data-rid="ef43cd54-727d-4d7f-9ef4-4785f788b40e" class="vy-r-qb6zz5" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="03beb5a9-b5ee-4df6-a8f2-2dc461303487" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3j8n32:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="vy-r-17ih8vi" style="cursor: pointer;"><div data-rid="c5b03118-4dcc-4ae2-b6c1-52024ab56e04" class="vy-r-rntx6q"><div data-rid="ae53901a-7e4b-4bb4-b919-4e295d534868" class="vy-r-1crgdrh vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>3.</h3></span></div><div data-rid="59a6cf52-d60d-436f-9411-556faba92dbe" class="vy-r-1tcva0x vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>A Guarantee That Pays Out</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="67aa36c4-7c9f-4946-a2c7-7169e669ada9" class="vy-r-1l2q89t" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-rboler" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="vy-replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3j8n32:" style=""><div style="padding:4px 24px 22px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#374151"><p>Read the guarantee before you buy. These are not the same length and they are not the same promise. One brand gives you a full year. Another gives you ninety days, but only on a first order, one product at a time. A third resolves to store credit instead of your money back. And one advertises sixty days while its own policy says thirty, unopened, return shipping on you.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6de8336c-da58-4455-be4f-0c4ba9bcd442" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="Top 5" tabindex="-1" id="Top 5" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="vy-r-et2xcs"><div data-rid="2cc2faac-45b5-45b6-b5b5-d346856bbf7e" class="vy-r-ixl5i3 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Top 5 Mullein Supplements Of 2026</h2></span></div><div data-rid="3ab169a4-d313-4ca1-98ed-2284514c3967" class="vy-r-12xmd0x vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I bought all five, used them for a month, and graded each one on those three tests plus the ordinary stuff: taste, price, and how the company behaves when you want your money back.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2af1b73c-e5d9-4f1b-ae8e-0a1b1d70f02f" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="rovinabox" tabindex="-1" id="rovinabox" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="vy-r-vi7uld"><div data-rid="6aaa9029-fa83-4fff-aaea-28a31596e79b" class="vy-r-bsdd9i"><div data-rid="9da53440-4bab-4826-9fec-921fdf6d72b9" class="vy-r-172144l"><div data-rid="8ea0a918-621f-4648-8e32-1733fb4ae6bd" class="vy-r-14yp21h"><div data-rid="997abd9c-2123-4e64-86c2-e07e004f2a5d" class="vy-r-cmafaz vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>1. BetterLungs&#174; Mullein + Chlorophyll</p></span></div><div data-rid="a8e442ee-d776-45a5-af4b-35e45a8fccde" class="vy-r-u7vacz vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>by <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://www.trybetterbrand.com/products/betterlungs%C2%AE-mullein-chlorophyll?variant=50211235954987"><span style="color: #2563EBFF"><u>Betterbrand</u></span></a></h3></span></div></div><picture data-rid="f7bbe206-f10f-42df-af84-c6f69993eb67" class="vy-r-1ewn7q"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-5.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-5.jpg" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-25.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px) a