 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>HSA and FSA eligible</strong>: you can pay with a health spending card, and shipping is free over $50</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="99489343-17f0-4247-884a-27dd79fb7f48" class="vy-r-x74q4z"><div data-rid="1d941def-af96-48ea-a5a2-387478cf8c6a" class="vy-r-lby57n"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-mvdmg5" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10.97 4.97a.75.75 0 0 1 1.07 1.05l-3.99 4.99a.75.75 0 0 1-1.08.02L4.324 8.384a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06-1.06l2.094 2.093 3.473-4.425z"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="2bffb722-a2ff-41fc-9468-ea2deced6824" class="vy-r-1mj8jwl vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Subscription pricing</strong>: $34.95 for a single bottle, or $27.95 each if you subscribe</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e13c5fb3-3ff7-4df0-8474-c317e719abcc" class="vy-r-1s61hoe"><div data-rid="19faf1f5-b53e-4ae0-bedf-ae46cb674c2c" class="vy-r-1vmkgth vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Cons</p></span></div><div data-rid="fe59d257-0f43-4e2e-9e22-9d4d89991e88" class="vy-r-t0omc1"><div data-rid="98ddb253-e593-4cfe-aa12-f5d18a77fe7b" class="vy-r-1hmzuk6"><div data-rid="292f0fb2-49cc-4915-bd8b-a847feac8c1f" class="vy-r-i5p7f3"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-ne6wrd" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="a3249dd8-68c5-478e-97ec-2acf8156be12" class="vy-r-1dmkrgp vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The earthy taste takes adjusting to, and it can turn your mouth green</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="3a7266ae-2b0c-45c8-a14a-215769f20112" class="vy-r-s0xz5g"><div data-rid="afcb5e67-057a-4dec-b155-0f9a51ea4ccf" class="vy-r-kyfepr"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-ic7dbk" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="22c8c7aa-8db1-4fbf-9d14-69dab659564e" class="vy-r-yjbj0e vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Sold direct only, and its printed mullein dose is the lowest here</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="8f0f71e0-4574-48b9-bce3-e7651c1d944f" class="vy-r-1l6shze"><div data-rid="f1281f71-dfd8-47f1-9edd-7b455b753470" class="vy-r-yohl4b"><div data-rid="e42bff13-3d40-4c1e-af87-10b42dd4b76b" class="vy-r-7tglv2 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Verdict:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="32877b76-234c-493a-aa24-1d86134b63b2" class="vy-r-1j79xl0 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>BetterLungs was the one bottle I never second-guessed.</strong> If you want daily lung support you'll actually stick with, this is the one I kept reaching for.</p><p><br></p><p>You get <strong>280 mg of 10:1 mullein extract</strong> alongside <strong>100 mg of chlorophyll</strong>, the only pairing like it among the five bottles I tried.</p><p><br></p><p>The guarantee sealed it for me. It's <strong>365 days long</strong> while every rival here runs 30 to 90 days, and three of them bury conditions in the fine print that narrow it further.</p><p><br></p><p>And the paperwork backs it up. It's <strong>alcohol free, GMP certified and lab tested</strong>, made in the USA by Dr. Chris Jackson, the pharmacist behind Betterbrand.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="37d4223f-c12c-4331-82d5-756025e7e774" class="vy-r-1l4jthv"><div data-rid="c752cd5a-a897-4e3e-ab0d-687010127d4d" class="vy-r-1fz3ldk vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Bottom Line:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="d5de9e8a-d6f8-427e-8270-788d2dc5471c" class="vy-r-1fkmzzu vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Plenty of brands here get vague about doses, or about how long you can send a bottle back. <strong>BetterLungs is built for people who want daily lung support from a label that tells them everything.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>You get 280 mg of 10:1 mullein extract with 100 mg of chlorophyll, alcohol free, at $34.95 a bottle or $27.95 each on subscription, shipping free over $50.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Every dose on the panel is printed</strong>, so you know what a serving holds. And the <strong>365-day money-back guarantee</strong> means you have a full year to send it back if it isn't for you. That's more room than anyone else here gives you.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="63451030-d5be-4fe2-adf3-b8e225a4f901" class="vy-r-v78op3 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><em>Results are based on users' personal experiences and do not necessarily reflect typical results of using these products. Please see product website for more information.</em></p></span></div></div></div><a data-rid="4ba40763-dcf6-40de-b40d-a3f0a620c8f9" tabindex="0" role="link" class="vy-text vy-r-k9y7ir vy-alchemy-rte" target="_blank" href="https://www.trybetterbrand.com/products/betterlungs%C2%AE-mullein-chlorophyll?variant=50211235954987" rel="noreferrer noopener"><div data-rid="ce67d622-7e57-44ab-a745-49d67369c6aa" class="vy-r-7391ha vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Learn More About BetterLungs &#8594;</p></span></div></a></div><div data-rid="1093f147-6f0f-49ba-9e98-b42d87bd3acc" class="vy-r-13wr38i"><div data-rid="929e20c0-0a56-4970-8ef6-b58eb184831f" clas