/svg></div><div data-rid="6ca25910-2a8f-49f3-ba09-775891f9633d" class="vy-r-1oqaisa vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>In-House Survey</strong>: its customer figures rest on 53 to 80 responses</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f5482f2c-c46a-4071-86fe-720a2528287d" class="vy-r-1n252g4"><div data-rid="fbcf9353-3f1c-4f20-a18f-cbf260198110" class="vy-r-19dwwjw"><div data-rid="68d88cae-b581-47e8-89db-77ce7b1207bd" class="vy-r-13j6myz vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Verdict:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="1d637d35-0cab-443f-8257-25336d7734d5" class="vy-r-1t5nbb5 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>SuperBonsai prints everything. Seven herbs, all 10:1 extracts, 2,000 mg per 2 ml serving, each on its own line: mullein 800 mg, elderberry 400, marshmallow 300, astragalus 200, reishi 160, tangerine peel 100, licorice 40. No proprietary blend. On mullein alone it out-doses BetterLungs and I won't pretend otherwise. At 4.7 stars from 258 reviews, it's the closest thing to a real rival here.</p><br><p>Where it slips is the fine print. The headline figures are about individual herbs, not this bottle, and its own asterisk admits the amounts differ. The customer stats come from a survey of 53 to 80 people.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="afc1cf99-62bf-4e72-829e-4e7821f8f87c" class="vy-r-14dbcvh"><div data-rid="09c7e5da-0689-440b-abff-8a0ae284db38" class="vy-r-misfhq vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Bottom Line:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="efc8c00d-c06b-4345-ac4f-bfbdde0fba0f" class="vy-r-w59pgy vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>If BetterLungs sold out, this is what I'd order next, and it wouldn't feel like settling. It's $42.95 a bottle, US shipping only, and the guarantee is 90 conditional days instead of a flat year. That's the gap.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="abfb96ea-a989-4fce-a9ca-3517086a0c55" class="vy-r-1xj8n9p vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><em>Rankings reflect our own comparison of published labels, prices and guarantees. Individual experiences with any supplement will vary.</em></p></span></div></div></div><button data-rid="b9045fbe-2617-489f-81eb-a8febc67e518" class="vy-text vy-r-1th926h vy-alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="e9f98425-d371-419d-8057-4abe92d3f5ce" class="vy-r-uw8ok1 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Learn More &#8594;</p></span></div></button></div><div data-rid="6bb99920-ff54-4f46-b3eb-55910b9f7782" class="vy-r-ystzkc"><div data-rid="975095a0-98ab-4eb9-a80a-6b3564c6067e" class="vy-r-1fs74x2"><div data-rid="791bb7a5-1b9e-40d7-bc13-39bac337438e" class="vy-r-vdybu6"><div data-rid="3c086b34-bc79-429b-b1f2-77a731e5b3f8" class="vy-r-86qkqo vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>3. Organic Mullein Drops for Lungs</h2></span></div><div data-rid="5194fc5e-9965-4b75-a398-459f47b20477" class="vy-r-82qhex vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>by Why Not Natural</h3></span></div></div><picture data-rid="a9b50d07-95a1-4ef5-8604-9933efd78055" class="vy-r-1l1if01"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-9.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-9.jpg" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-9.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-9.jpg" alt="A line drawing icon of a third-place award ribbon on a green background." class="vy-r-1dnhqkf"></picture></div><div data-rid="ea3ed87b-156c-4261-99c8-58dcf0c443a2" class="vy-r-lj9o6t"><div data-rid="d0028f07-fce0-4d0f-a085-00d46e77956b" class="vy-r-z96h99"><picture data-rid="3350b2b6-6ca0-405e-b9ef-f0e77d12e91b" class="vy-r-qris5v"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-10.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><sour