L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="602f7af9-1b3f-499c-a190-424c90268c23" class="vy-r-dskugn vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Mullein Alone:</strong> One herb, with nothing else in the bottle</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="69d44011-03f6-4bb6-9bf8-49a711ad1a0b" class="vy-r-2ody5r"><div data-rid="cfb82a9b-92a7-42a3-856e-880007f77660" class="vy-r-9j8tcl"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-1od4b99" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="b372d805-ede8-4704-ad97-6d7ba92f86bf" class="vy-r-zaksuc vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Dosing Conflicts:</strong> The page says 1 ml, the label says 1 to 2 ml</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="13eff614-1504-4c30-94b3-93fdb72b8ae8" class="vy-r-l3am6t"><div data-rid="688322ff-a0ee-44e3-87f0-e566e0f8e86b" class="vy-r-bg2bld"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-ijnmuc" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="7413d740-16bc-4585-a714-9001cb05ee2e" class="vy-r-16dji9x vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>60 Servings, Maybe:</strong> That count only holds at the smallest dose</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f021a739-c847-4096-b931-5aae2015fda5" class="vy-r-46tj3v"><div data-rid="756334df-999d-4771-91db-f1ac2d425a7b" class="vy-r-18xq1yz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="vy-r-1axnsg4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="6627d6ab-6ce2-4655-933b-93b64f1b8b61" class="vy-r-1jp6dwq vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Credit, Not Cash:</strong> The 60-day return is a swap or credit</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3d8a8771-0796-4097-82e9-1a5b50470fbb" class="vy-r-mxxy84"><div data-rid="3d81c8dc-04f1-476e-bbe0-ce886407352a" class="vy-r-zckoej"><div data-rid="ea620a26-7693-4157-88fa-2cd4c9131569" class="vy-r-112prw9 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Verdict:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="38d0832b-cffa-4625-a6eb-2ae11bbb786e" class="vy-r-1mq99bz vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The shortest ingredient list in this group, and I mean that as praise. Organic mullein, organic glycerin, purified water. It is genuinely USDA Organic through Oregon Tilth, alcohol free, vegan, gluten free, cGMP and made in the USA.</p><br><p>The label prints 1,000 mg of organic mullein leaf extract per 1 ml, stated as dry herb equivalent at a 1:3 menstruum, so it is not the same number as a 10:1 extract and I would not read it that way. Then there are the reviews. Two of them.<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="922d8514-1634-46f5-83d6-516cb9417f46" class="vy-r-pxjuei"><div data-rid="2f4a2945-51de-46aa-a7e1-bd7b676d2c0a" class="vy-r-1m8olcp vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Bottom Line:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="f2275a60-e89e-47a8-b388-2d639c52c4b6" class="vy-r-1hh99k0 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Plainest label and cheapest bottle in the group, $21.97 or $18.67 on subscription, and the dropper is marked in ml. Just know the 60-day guarantee resolves as a swap or store credit, and shipping is not refunded.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="14091a9b-399f-428c-9b9b-5237b338da2b" class="vy-r-x0q6nv vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><em>Grades reflect my own comparison of published labels, prices and guarantees, and are not a promise of any individual outcome.</em></p></span></div></div></div><button data-rid="6514f352-d3e8-42cd-bd32-9e3a302f9e64" class="vy-text vy-r-12j4hj7 vy-alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="044a4917-b492-43f7-9e7a-39dd657d5b83" class="vy-r-tiljkv vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Learn More &#8594;</p></span></div></button></div><div data-rid="e80cee71-a3a8-45fd-a7f6-f525a46dd696" class="vy-r-1mrkfq5"><div data-rid="a57d06bd-e860-462e-90ab-e74c9cfa8eda" class="vy-r-1jieqmy"><div data-rid="948746d1-8b77-4678-8ac4-a85eac0b7277" class="vy-r-aaem5p"><div data-rid="6a56a115-afda-4e6b-bd10-7d6649b180f4" class="vy-r-1izpnxg vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>4. Mullein Leaf Drops</h2></span></div><div data-rid="c4269ff6-b656-485f-a226-95defc4c8559" class="vy-r-tbtlp9 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>by Wild &amp; Organic</h3></span></div></div><picture data-rid="2e11fc7e-1ed1-4238-a895-f01c91264d90" class="vy-r-16uys8q"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-11.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-11.jpg" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-11.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-11.jpg" alt="A gray line drawing of a fourth-place award ribbon." class="vy-r-1okumim"