1 .708 0L8 7.293l2.646-2.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708L8.707 8l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 0 1-.708.708L8 8.707l-2.646 2.647a.5.5 0 0 1-.708-.708L7.293 8 4.646 5.354a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div><div data-rid="f00a03c3-f8ec-4084-badb-da10b5b6671c" class="vy-r-8qidf9 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Licorice Root Inside</strong> &#183; worth a word with your doctor if you take it daily</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d7e085b5-4a43-4b7c-a634-0c995ff9a6e0" class="vy-r-7ikkn6"><div data-rid="a9ee4ef9-e7c5-430f-9507-db99ec90a3db" class="vy-r-1f6r9x6"><div data-rid="1e6df2d8-2ec4-4088-a5b5-313053032db5" class="vy-r-1ez7t2p vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Verdict:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="0bcfb2ff-a822-44d8-ae9c-7f3108e746b0" class="vy-r-13z1fg7 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>This is the value pick, and it isn't close. $30.99 buys a 4 oz bottle with 168 servings in it, which works out around 18 cents each. It also prints a real mg figure for all three herbs: mullein 700, echinacea 100, licorice 30. A lot of tinctures in this category never bother.</p><br></span></div></div><div data-rid="a9027a29-444a-4015-ad07-d0987adcd161" class="vy-r-1gbtd6a"><div data-rid="ce4b9d7f-6c5d-415c-a677-3feaa9990025" class="vy-r-daxlw7 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>The Bottom Line:</h3></span></div><div data-rid="c7b96f50-6d9b-4993-9109-e98cbd007547" class="vy-r-n51p8j vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>My hesitation is the rating. 3.3 from 25 reviews on its own site is the weakest score here, though several one-star entries read like praise, so part of that average looks like a tagging error. The missing extract ratio bothers me more. Without it, 700 mg is just a number.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="bfa7bb5b-779f-435e-8043-3c2c0f7b8c10" class="vy-r-1wtnm9r vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><em>Rankings are our own opinion, based on each brand's published label, price and guarantee, and are not a promise of any particular outcome.</em></p></span></div></div></div><button data-rid="134deb8f-5568-4cf2-8b93-b17a8cb9f4d7" class="vy-text vy-r-gr8m06 vy-alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="9347bed0-180d-4c6b-a0a8-e853c6fbd7ed" class="vy-r-41kiq4 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Learn More &#8594;</p></span></div></button></div><div data-rid="9db0c29d-84d6-4249-b223-e14d56cbbf67" class="vy-r-rh78c6"><div data-rid="53b59192-4564-44ae-a727-5f53d6f93be1" class="vy-r-czl457"><div data-rid="0412019e-1d36-4e96-a1aa-71a450ed44b0" class="vy-r-oh9hqd"><div data-rid="96499936-5e47-4413-ac1c-b0dcf49a00b3" class="vy-r-1lh2lsg vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>5. UltimaPeak Mullein Gummies</h2></span></div><div data-rid="645b1e4a-6b19-426d-8f93-8be03f0f6a52" class="vy-r-zy17l5 vy-alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>by UltimaPeak</h3></span></div></div><picture data-rid="435e8719-2fd5-43d2-9652-a8106d43865a" class="vy-r-1adelph"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-13.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-13.jpg" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-23.jpg" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-13.jpg" alt="A gray line drawing of a fifth-place award ribbon." class="vy-r-1bk63rw"></picture></div><div data-rid="dfa87b16-9b5d-403e-a370-3de5f98e6823" class="vy-r-42mne"><div data-rid="d044f276-934b-41b9-8c5f-7db3058cfed7" class="vy-r-1wd0jt7"><picture data-rid="9d761504-b1d3-410b-ab5c-423322898dee" class="vy-r-v7cnbg"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-14.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)"><source srcset="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-677-betterbrand/images/img-14.jpg" media="(min-w